  annotation = {TLDR: A deep learning model, long short-term memory (LSTM) neural networks, is adopted to model the two basic behaviors simultaneously of car-following and lane-changing, and the results show that HRC LSTM model can accurately estimate CF and LC behaviors simultaneously with low longitudinal trajectories error and high LC prediction accuracy compared with the classical models.},
